   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Twinning on Statistics</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Twinning on Statistics</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Projects aims to support exchange and institutional cooperation between SCB (Statistics Sweden) and Instituto Nacional de Estadistica. More in particular, the projects supports the provision of two long-term consultants from SCB to INE, and a number of shorter exchange missions in areas such as gendered statistics, municipal statistics etc.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till institutionssamarbete mellan SCB och Instituto Nacional de Estadistica. Projektet st&#xF6;der placeringen av tv&#xE5; l&#xE5;ngtidskonsulter fr&#xE5;n SCB p&#xE5; INE, samt en m&#xE4;ngd utbytesmissioner inom omr&#xE5;den som genderstatistik, kommunstatistik, etc.</narrative>
  </description>
